START
  Create matrix A (2x2)
  Create matrix B (2x2)
  Create 3D array arr (2x2x2)

  Perform operations:
    matrix_add = A + B
    matrix_mul = A * B (element-wise)
    matrix_dot = A %*% B (matrix multiplication)

  Perform array operation:
    arr2 = arr + 2

  Display all results

  Analyze:
    Element-wise vs matrix multiplication difference
END
